<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets warrants on Hongkong Telecom.</title>
<headline>UBS sets warrants on Hongkong Telecom.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland Hong Kong Branch said on Wednesday it had launched 180 million American-style call warrants on shares of Hong Kong Telecommunications Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	 HK$15.03	 PREMIUM	    13.58 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.3938	GEARING	    4.24x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	   11.JUN.98	SETTLEMENT DATE  09.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING		HONG KONG	LISTING DATE     11.JUL.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT     HK$16.70	 EXER LOT	   4,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
